<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 100 mln rand 3-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 100 mln rand 3-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0	MATURITY    16.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
